<Positioned left="494" top="258"><Text fontSize="20" color="#22374B" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">跨档月怎么算</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="494" top="292"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7383" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">上月末累计 2,700 度</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="494" top="320"><Text fontSize="17" color="#6A7383" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC">本月 480 度 → 拆两段</Text></Positioned>
